# Web3Forms access key for the "Notify me" newsletter popup.
# Get a free key at https://web3forms.com — enter the email address where you
# want signups delivered, and the key is emailed to you instantly.
#
# This is a PUBLIC token (safe to expose in client-side code); it only routes
# submissions to your inbox. Copy this file to `.env` and paste your key below.
# For production, set the same variable in Vercel → Project → Settings →
# Environment Variables (it's read at build time).
PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=your-access-key-here
